<!--
  DRS privacy hardening (S-9): the keyboard stores typed text derivatives
  (user dictionary, learned words, clipboard history, per-app profile data)
  inside its private sandbox. None of that may ever leave the device via
  the platform cloud-backup or device-transfer machinery, so cloud backup is
  disabled in the manifest (android:allowBackup="false") and both rule files
  are intentionally EMPTY (no include = nothing eligible, belt-and-braces).
  See PRIVACY.md for the full data policy.
-->
<full-backup-content />
